<title>FRANCE: Cr. Foncier securitises loans.</title>
<headline>Cr. Foncier securitises loans.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Credit Foncier de France spokesman said on Friday the property lender has launched a securitisation of some 1,000 loans to local councils worth a total 6.9 billion francs.</p>
<p>The spokesman was confirming a report in financial daily L'Agefi which said the distressed lender had auctioned off a 5.6 billion franc loan portfolio in June.</p>
<p>The two transactions are of differing natures but have the same aim of improving its lending capabilities and short-term funding capacity.</p>
<p>Credit Foncier earlier posted first-half net attributable profit of 402 million francs, compared to 12 million a year ago.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
